Package: omicsaudit
Title: Black-Box Audit Toolkit for Omics Biomarker Pipelines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("omicsaudit", "authors", email = "benabanks@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Audits biomarker analysis pipelines by controlling the data
    that goes in, using planted signals. Also provides a zoo of
    deliberately flawed pipelines with known answers.
